Costume Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Major productions"},{"text":"Large costume departments"},{"text":"Period/fantasy work"},{"text":"Production leadership"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8–12+ years"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Costume Designer → Costume Department Head / Independent Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Creative direction"},{"text":"Large productions"},{"text":"Multiple teams"},{"text":"Budget"},{"text":"Brand/reputation"},{"text":"Mentoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"Costume design will increasingly combine physical garment-making with digital fashion, virtual production, AI-assisted concept development, 3D simulation, and immersive media."},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital Costume Designer"},{"text":"Virtual Production Costume Designer"},{"text":"AI Costume Concept Designer"},{"text":"3D Costume Designer"},{"text":"Virtual Fashion Designer"},{"text":"Digital Character Wardrobe Designer"},{"text":"Metaverse Costume Designer"},{"text":"XR Costume Designer"},{"text":"Digital Fashion Stylist"},{"text":"Costume Technology Specialist"},{"text":"Historical Costume Digitisation Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI applications"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Costume concept generation"},{"text":"Moodboards"},{"text":"Colour exploration"},{"text":"Character references"},{"text":"Historical research assistance"},{"text":"Design variations"},{"text":"Fabric visualisation"},{"text":"Costume continuity databases"},{"text":"Digital wardrobe generation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But the designer remains responsible for storytelling, cultural accuracy, historical interpretation, garment construction, fit, movement, material decisions, actor needs, and final creative judgement."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Fashion"},