roject."},{"type":"p","text":"Each case study should show:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Script/Character","Research","Concept","Moodboard","Colour & Silhouette","Costume Sketch","Textile/Material","Construction/Sourcing","Fitting","Continuity","Final Look"]},{"type":"p","text":"For professional costume design, production credits, relationships within the film/theatre/fashion ecosystem, practical construction ability, and a strong visual portfolio often matter more than certificates alone."}]}]}